eignobject_content"><span id="S4.F3.pic1.5" class="ltx_text" style="--ltx-fg-color:#009900;">delivered</span></span></span></foreignObject></g></g><g style="--ltx-fg-color:#FF0000;" color="#FF0000" stroke-dasharray="3.0pt,3.0pt" stroke-dashoffset="0.0pt" stroke-width="0.8pt"><g style="--ltx-stroke-color:#FF0000;--ltx-fill-color:#FF0000;" fill="#FF0000" stroke="#FF0000"><path style="fill:none" d="M -6.46 -162.02 C 68.3 -141.06 112.85 -95.47 130.6 -26.01"></path></g><g style="--ltx-stroke-color:#FF0000;--ltx-fill-color:#FF0000;" fill="#FF0000" stroke="#FF0000" stroke-dasharray="none" stroke-dashoffset="0.0pt" stroke-linejoin="miter" transform="matrix(0.24763 0.96886 -0.96886 0.24763 129.82 -29.09)"><path d="M 7.66 0 L 1.79 2.18 L 3.45 0 L 1.79 -2.18 Z"></path></g><g style="--ltx-stroke-color:#FF0000;--ltx-fill-color:#FF0000;--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" color="#000000" fill="#FF0000" stroke="#FF0000" transform="matrix(0.51584 0.85669 -0.85669 0.51584 102.61 -117.35)"><foreignObject style="--ltx-fo-width:5.03em;--ltx-fo-height:0.69em;--ltx-fo-depth:0em;font-size:10pt;" height="9.61" overflow="visible" transform="matrix(1 0 0 -1 0 9.61)" width="69.61"><span class="ltx_foreignobject_container"><span class="ltx_foreignobject_content"><span id="S4.F3.pic1.6" class="ltx_text" style="--ltx-fg-color:#FF0000;">undelivered</span></span></span></foreignObject></g></g></g></svg></span>
<figcaption class="ltx_caption ltx_centering"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_figure">Fig. 3: </span>Violation of Axiom <a href="#Thmaxiom1" title="Axiom 1. ‣ The Communication Postulate ‣ III-C Core Axioms ‣ III The Formal Framework: Model and Axioms ‣ Decoupling Correctness from Policy: A Deterministic Causal Structure for Multi-Agent Systems" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">1</span></a> (Weak Fairness). The failure to deliver a contribution to all relevant agents results in permanently divergent local states (<math id="S4.F3.m2" class="ltx_Math" alttext="M_{u}^{*}\neq M_{v}^{*}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><msubsup><mi>M</mi><mi>u</mi><mo>∗</mo></msubsup><mo>≠</mo><msubsup><mi>M</mi><mi>v</mi><mo>∗</mo></msubsup></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">M_{u}^{*}\neq M_{v}^{*}</annotation></semantics></math>), breaking the guarantee of value convergence.</figcaption>
</figure>
